Adapted files (app/src/main/java/com/elrstelemetri/n3/): LogicLinkDecoder,
H264AnnexBAssembler, N3ControlPackets, N3Session and N3UsbLink. Each file states
the changes made. No branded artwork from that project is included.

The N3 control packets originate from samuelsadok/dji_protocol
(https://github.com/samuelsadok/dji_protocol, commit
50c71b65fdb6825783f724e5cd3c1f09c2aa88ce).

DJI FPV Goggles V2 video (app/src/main/java/com/elrstelemetri/v2/V2UsbLink.java)
uses the USB protocol documented by DigiView-Android
(https://github.com/fpvout/DigiView-Android, MIT License) and fpv.wtf: USB IDs
2CA3:001F, interface 3, the "RMVT" start packet and re-sending it when the stream
stalls. The implementation was written for this app; no DigiView code is copied.

